  🎯 Why This Approach is Ideal for ADK

  1. Separation of Concerns

  - FastAPI: Handles HTTP protocol, request validation, CORS
  - ADK Sessions: Handles intelligent conversation management
  - Frontend: Pure presentation layer (thin client)

  2. ADK Best Practices Compliance

  - Thin Client: Frontend only handles UI, all logic on backend
  - Session Persistence: Conversations survive across interactions
  - Context Awareness: Maintains conversation flow and topic understanding
  - Agent Orchestration: Tracks which agents handled what requests

  3. Scalability & Maintenance

  - Modular: Each component has clear responsibilities
  - Testable: Can test session logic independently (as we just did!)
  - Extensible: Easy to add new agents or session features
  - Cloud-Ready: Stateless HTTP layer with stateful session management

