  🚀 Recommendation: Keep Both Layers

  Why you need FastAPI + ADK Sessions together:

  FastAPI Layer (Keep it!)

  - Web Interface: Your Streamlit frontend needs HTTP endpoints
  - API Standards: RESTful design for potential mobile/web clients
  - Validation: Ensures data integrity with Pydantic models
  - Documentation: Auto-generated API docs for other developers
  - Security: Authentication, rate limiting, CORS handling

  ADK Session Layer (The core intelligence)

  - Conversation Intelligence: What makes your agent "smart"
  - Context Persistence: Maintains conversation memory
  - Agent Orchestration: Routes to appropriate specialists
  - Analytics: Insights into user behavior and agent performance

